# The build context is the repository root (k8s/Dockerfile and
# dockerd/Dockerfile both COPY from it), so anything left here is uploaded
# to the daemon on every build - and .secrets/ holds the fleet's commit
# key. Neither Dockerfile COPYs it, but a build context is not the place
# to find that out.
.secrets/
.clever.json
fleet.conf
fleet.conf.bak
vms.txt
persistent/
node_modules/
.git/
*.log
